  "raw": "{\"answer\":\"HippoRAG 一侧：原文明确写道“Given a new query, HippoRAG identifies the key concepts in the query and runs the Personalized PageRank (PPR) algorithm [30] on the KG, using the query concepts as the seeds, to integrate information across passages for retrieval”，即查询种子是问题中的关键概念，PPR 以这些概念为种子在知识图谱上运行以实现跨段落检索 [chunk_a58244558a2137d85a4b8e53d5c4ebaf]。同段还称“PPR enables HippoRAG to explore KG paths and identify relevant subgraphs, essentially performing multi-hop reasoning in a single retrieval step”，说明它通过 PPR 探索图路径而非显式生成关系路径 [chunk_a58244558a2137d85a4b8e53d5c4ebaf]。关于路径发现类多跳问题，原文称“HippoRAG leverages its web of associations in its hippocampal index and graph search algorithm to determine that Professor Thomas is relevant to this query and retrieves his passages appropriately”，即借助关联网络与图搜索完成检索 [chunk_900d1ff5b080ca47760a93ddc7d9e173]。RoG 一侧：所给证据只表明“the importance of relation paths for improving the reasoning performance of LLMs on complex questions”，并在不同跳数上比较 RoG 与其变体 [chunk_853c2cdb088533bc71f93f42690919ae]；没有任何引句描述 RoG 的查询种子、关系路径计划如何生成、或从问题到有效推理路径的具体流程，因此 RoG 的流程证据不足，无法与 HippoRAG 逐环节对比。\",\"citations\":[{\"chunk_id\":\"chunk_a58244558a2137d85a4b8e53d5c4ebaf\",\"quote_id\":\"q2\"},{\"chunk_id\":\"chunk_900d1ff5b080ca47760a93ddc7d9e173\",\"quote_id\":\"q2\"},{\"chunk_id\":\"chunk_853c2cdb088533bc71f93f42690919ae\",\"quote_id\":\"q1\"}],\"status\":\"partial\"}",
